abstract: >-
  The Quran Vision Corpus (v6.3.0; supersedes v6.2.3), led and authored by Project Lead & Principal Investigator Mehmet Yarıcı (ORCID: 0009-0003-0356-8582; Uludağ University Faculty of Theology / Republic of Türkiye Ministry of National Education), with Academic Advisor Mehmet Emin Koç (ORCID: 0000-0002-1025-5643; Azerbaijan National Academy of Sciences / AMEA, Institute of Philosophy and Sociology), is a bilingual (Turkish/English) academic research corpus and interactive digital cockpit comprising 16 foundational Quranic verse monographs (32 TR/EN monographs: QV-2026-001 through QV-2026-016, including Kahf 18:83-98 and the Unified Dual-Table Z-5 Standard). Quality Assurance & Source Verification: gem_lint.py (V1–V17 Algorithmic Audit) & V16.2 Multi-Server Source Registry (190/190 Verified Sources: 138 Shamela + 18 Altafsir + 34 Institutional; Internal Sample Verification: 60/190 [31.6%] — Mehmet Yarıcı). PDF Inventory: 36 Külliyat PDF'i (32 Tekil Monografi + 2 TR/EN Tam Külliyat [v6.3.0] + 1 İSNAD-2 Klasik Arapça Veritabanları Rehberi [ISNAD_2_Klasik_Arapca_Veritabanlari_Rehberi.pdf] + 1 TYMM DKAB 15 Âyet Ders Tasarımı Rehberi [TYMM_DKAB_15_Ayet_Ders_Tasarimi_Rehberi.pdf]) + 2 III. Maarif Kongresi (MOIJUB) Bildiri PDF'i (Özet + Tam Metin) — Toplam 38 PDF.
